creasing our guidance to beyond $5 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/novartis-international-ag-nvs-q4-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NVS 2020 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vasant Narasimhan","x":"Newer products of course have much smaller split because there have been fewer price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/novartis-international-ag-nvs-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NVS 2020 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Purcell","x":"And then secondly, in terms of pricing in the US, at the beginning of the year, you guided to net prices declining by around 2.5% in the US with US list price increases you put through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/novartis-international-ag-nvs-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NVS 2020 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"With these assumptions, on slide 36, we confirm our full year outlook, continue operational sales expected to grow mid to high single digit and core operating income expected to grow ahead of sales and increasing the margin at high single to low double digit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/novartis-international-ag-nvs-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NVS 2020 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2020-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vasant Narasimhan","x":"Thank you. [Technical Issues] in Q1 and we are maintaining our full year outlook as Harry has nicely outlined.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/novartis-international-ag-nvs-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"NVS 2020 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2020-07-21","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"So our focus is the OTC -- the DTC campaigns in the U.S., continuing the momentum, 50% access to date and trying to grow that access going forward in Part D. A