 the second point, yes, they would include the U.S. And then on the question on cost savings, I will give it to Harry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/novartis-nvs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2021 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"So I would say most of the cops -- cost savings we can keep.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/novartis-nvs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2021 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2021-04-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"We confirmed full-year guidance both for group and innovative medicines for sales and core operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/novartis-nvs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2021 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2021-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Richard Parkes","x":"If I look at sales per script over the last few quarters, at least in the first half, it looks like sales per script has been growing in double digits, which seems to imply quite significant price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/novartis-nvs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2021 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2021-07-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"We confirm full-year guidance for both the group sales and core operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/novartis-nvs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2021 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Marie-France Tschudin","x":"And now let me pass it on to Susanne.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/novartis-nvs-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2022-04-26","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"Our DTC is now initiated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/c