gement","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And then, lastly, we continue to streamline the portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/19/novartis-nvs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2022-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And we'll continue to look to streamline the medicine portfolio inner pipeline so that we can focus on the medicines that matter most in our core therapeutic areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/19/novartis-nvs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2022-07-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And we've raised the full year guidance for Sandoz.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/19/novartis-nvs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2022-07-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"So, we've raised the guidance, as I mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/19/novartis-nvs-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2022-10-25","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"We do have a very active DTC campaign to activate patients on the benefits of a twice-a-year therapy that can deliver up to 60% lowering on LDL cholesterol.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/25/novartis-nvs-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2022-10-25","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Simon Baker","x":"And also related to that, you are running a DTC campaign with two adverts at the moment in the U.S. for Leqvio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/25/novartis-nvs-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2022-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"Operating and net income declined in the quarter, mainly due to higher impairments of about $0.5 billion and higher restructuring costs of about $0.4 billion versus prior year which were mainly due to the implementation of our previously announced streamlined organizational model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/25/novartis-nvs-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2022-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"We continue to expect to deliver USD 1.5 billion in structural cost savings to be fully embedded by 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/25/novartis-nvs-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2022-10-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"We continue to maintain our growth momentum, and we confirm our 2022 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/25/novartis-nvs-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2023-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"We're streamlining the pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/01/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2022 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2023-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"Operating income was down 13%, mainly due to the higher restructuring costs related to the implementation of our streamlined organizational model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/01/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2023-07-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"…of the consumer health business, Alcon, Roche stake, now the proposal on Sandoz, alongside that streaming down to -- streamlining down to five therapeutic areas, exiting areas like liver, as well as diabetes and now front of the eye, really, I think we're in the right place in terms of the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/18/novartis-ag-nvs-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2023-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"In summary, a very strong first half of the year as our efforts to focus and streamline the business continue to pay off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/18/novartis-ag-nvs-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2023-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And that wouldn't require us to take any additional cost out because we had already assumed Entresto would go in mid-2025 as our forecasting assumption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/18/novartis-ag-nvs-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2023-07-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And as you saw in our release earlier today, Novartis delivered strong sales growth, excellent margin expansion, and we were able to raise our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/18/novartis-ag-nvs-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q2","e":"nvs","d":"2023-07-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"But as you saw, we raised our full year guidance for both sales and core operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/18/novartis-ag-nvs-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2023-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"And in addition to the sales growth, the cost savings related to our ongoing productivity programs that we started last year also contribute to our significant core margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/24/novartis-ag-nvs-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2023-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"But operationally, the underlying growth was more in line with 10% in the quarter versus the reported of 12%, But still, in summary, a very strong first nine months of the year as our efforts to focus and streamline the business continue to pay off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/24/novartis-ag-nvs-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2023-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"So, coming to the first slide, as you saw earlier this morning, we delivered strong sales growth, margin expansion, and we were able to raise our guidance for the third time this year, along with the successful spin of Sandoz.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/24/novartis-ag-nvs-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q3","e":"nvs","d":"2023-10-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And this allowed us to raise our guidance which Harry will go through in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/24/novartis-ag-nvs-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2024-01-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"We also continue to invest in artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/31/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2024-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"In the quarter, top-line growth was 10%, core operating income grew 13% as outlook in October, quarter 4 of '22 was very high-profit quarter to be compared to given that we were in the middle of our restructuring then.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/31/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2024-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"I tried to explain, maybe I was not very successful, in October that quarter 4 of '22 was a very low-spend quarter because we're in the middle of a big restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/31/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2023 Q4","e":"nvs","d":"2024-01-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"We maintain our guidance on for forecasting purposes that an interest to LOE would not occur until 2025, and we also maintain our guidance on EU regulatory data protection to November 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/31/novartis-ag-nvs-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2024 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2024-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"So in summary, very strong start to the year as our efforts to focus and streamline the business continue to pay off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/23/novartis-ag-nvs-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2024 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2024-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Harry Kirsch","x":"That's a consequence also of the full implementation of transformation for growth, restructuring programs, leaning out, going to one organization locally between pharma onco and leading out above country and customer-facing functions, our organizational structures and leading our processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/23/novartis-ag-nvs-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2024 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2024-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And with the strong momentum we see in the business, we're able to raise our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/23/novartis-ag-nvs-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NVS 2024 Q1","e":"nvs","d":"2024-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vas Narasimhan","x":"And I think that also, I think, gives us confidence to raise the guidance